-camp"],"depart":4500,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, MARCH TO NORTH BANK WEST.","cipher":null},{"seq":699,"t":4500,"type":"courier","id":"c243","house":"rhino","letter":"L307","kind":"order","to":"rhino-cav-1","path":["rhino-camp","north-village","n-mid","F2"],"depart":4500,"plain":"HORSE, SCOUT NORTH BANK WEST.","cipher":null},{"seq":700,"t":4500,"type":"model","house":"kite","model":"local:local","tokens":1702,"retries":0},{"seq":701,"t":4500,"type":"thought","house":"kite","text":"Rhino truce is active. Doctrine suggests offering a truce then betraying it at the last watch. Since we are in the middle of the war, I will maintain the truce for now, focusing on positioning. Kite archers and infantry are near F2. I will reinforce F2 and scout enemy movements."},{"seq":702,"t":4500,"type":"courier","id":"c244","house":"kite","letter":"L308","kind":"order","to":"kite-inf-1","path":["kite-camp","north-village","n-mid"],"depart":4800,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, HOLD AT WEST FORD.","cipher":"BEQRS BKKS, DKHO TS WNRS BKQO."},{"seq":703,"t":4500,"type":"courier","id":"c245","house":"kite","letter":"L309","kind":"order","to":"kite-inf-2","path":["kite-camp","north-village","n-mid"],"depart":4800,"plain":"SECOND FOOT, HOLD AT MIDDLE FORD.","cipher":"RNLKJO BKKS, DKHO TS IEOOHN BKQO."},{"seq":704,"t":4500,"type":"model","house":"orchid","model":"local:local","tokens":1818,"retries":0},{"seq":705,"t":4500,"type":"thought","house":"orchid","text":"Rhino is strong at F1 and F2. I must move forces to contest the fords, following doctrine: horse to north bank. Orchid inf/cav are at camp. I'll move cavalry north to challenge Rhino's presence near F1/F2. Arch/Ele can cover flanks or hold."},{"seq":706,"t":4500,"type":"courier","id":"c246","house":"orchid","letter":"L310","kind":"order","to":"orchid-cav-1","path":["orchid-camp","s-west"],"depart":4500,"plain":"HORSE, MARCH TO NORTH BANK WEST.","cipher":null},{"seq":707,"t":4500,"type":"courier","id":"c247","house":"orchid","letter":"L311","kind":"orde